## What's included

- Design system and page templates
- Copywriting and content loading
- CMS setup so the team can edit pages in the browser
- Hosting setup and deployment

## How it works

A two to three week build, priced fixed. Fortnightly review calls. Handover doc and a short video walkthrough at the end.

## Good fit for

Businesses ready to move on from a generic template site and want something they can actually maintain.
